WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.680
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No more watching Firefly!

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:10.320
The exact details of the incident have been
redacted from all official records, and any

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.789
witnesses have been given amnestics to forget
what they saw.

00:00:13.789 --> 00:00:18.080
But after last month's incident resulted in
several casualties, and put several more employees

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.599
in the psych ward, Dr. Bright has been barred
from watching Firefly ever again.

00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:28.109
Just to be safe, let's go ahead and ban Angel,
Buffy the Vampire Slayer, and Dollhouse too.

00:00:28.109 --> 00:00:30.179
Hell, just ban Joss Whedon altogether.

00:00:30.179 --> 00:00:33.980
We’ll never forgive him for that awful Justice
League movie.

